# Headless Claude Code execution log. claude-code-base-action writes its raw
# JSONL transcript to output.txt at the repo root; autobuild.yml's `git add -A`
# used to sweep it into every auto PR, so any two auto PRs conflicted on it by
# construction and the pipeline deadlocked itself. Never commit it.
output.txt
